      "seed": 1995629243,
      "version": 621,
      "versionNonce": 1777936565,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1745510159812,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "0. Reproduce the ICMLA interventions using the SAE-based replacement model\n1. Expand discussion on Tokenization\n2. Temporal/downstream coherence post-intervention: \n    - Measure LMPM k tokens post-intervention\n3. Markovian property of hidden states\n4. Stability of Markovian property post-intervention\n5. Vary the method of intervention:\n    - Originally intervened to remove a single piece from the board.\n    - Now, what if we remove 2 pieces or add a piece?\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "0. Reproduce the ICMLA interventions using the SAE-based replacement model\n1. Expand discussion on Tokenization\n2. Temporal/downstream coherence post-intervention: \n    - Measure LMPM k tokens post-intervention\n3. Markovian property of hidden states\n4. Stability of Markovian property post-intervention\n5. Vary the method of intervention:\n    - Originally intervened to remove a single piece from the board.\n    - Now, what if we remove 2 pieces or add a piece?\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
